  "description": "One finite solid segment with three marked collinear points. C is the upper-left endpoint, D the lower-right endpoint, and the point labelled x lies strictly between them, closer to D. All three labels are above their points. No extension past either endpoint, arrows, ticks, or other subfigures.",
  "source": {
    "image": {
